- Style-library techniques-endings.md §T238: agrees verbatim on mechanics, window (P13 @ 75–81 s), evidence (ev/t078-pestle-mash.jpg · clips/pestle-mash.mp4). Tier DESCRIBED — OWED #105. No digest↔register disagreement.
